# SkylineAR currently requires no environment variables to run locally.
# Overpass, Nominatim, Wikipedia, Wikidata, and NOAA use public endpoints.
# Install dependencies with bun install, then run bun run dev.
#
# LOVABLE_API_KEY is managed by Lovable Project Settings, is not used by
# application source, and must not be copied into this template or client code.
#
# If a future integration requires configuration, add its variable NAME with
# a blank value here. Never prefix private credentials with VITE_.